{"seq":3,"slug":"agent-observability-tracing-cost","title":"可观测性、追踪与成本/延迟治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/agentic-ai-engineering-systems/agent-runtime-systems/agent-observability-tracing-cost","wordCount":2448,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"可观测性-追踪与成本-延迟治理\">可观测性、追踪与成本/延迟治理</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一个只会返回字符串的聊天接口，日志里丢一条 request-id 就能排障；而一个会自主调用十几次工具、跨多个子智能体转发的运行时，故障不再出现在「一次调用」，而出现在「哪一步用了哪个模型、花了多少 token、为什么慢」。传统 APM 的「服务 → 接口」两级粒度不够用，Agent 的观测对象是<strong>一条带树形结构的执行轨迹（trace）</strong>：根 span 是整轮任务，下面挂着 <code>invoke_agent</code>（子智能体调用）与 <code>execute_tool</code>（工具执行）span，最底层才是 <code>chat</code>（模型推理）span。</p>\n<p>这三个问题的代价是量级性的。Anthropic 工程团队实测：<strong>单个 Agent 的 token 消耗约为普通聊天的 4 倍，多智能体系统约为 15 倍</strong>；在 BrowseComp 基准上，token 用量、工具调用次数、模型选择三个因子解释了 <strong>95%</strong> 的性能方差，单看 token 用量就占 <strong>80%</strong>（<a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/engineering/multi-agent-research-system\">Anthropic: How we built our multi-agent research system</a>）。观测必须前置：没有逐 span 的 token 计量，循环失控会在你发现之前烧穿预算——OWASP LLM Top 10（2025）把这种情况单列为 <strong>LLM10：无限消耗</strong>（<a href=\"https://genai.owasp.org/llmrisk/llm01-prompt-injection/\">OWASP LLM Top 10</a>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[一次用户任务&lt;br/&gt;root span] --&gt; B[invoke_agent&lt;br/&gt;主智能体]&#10;    B --&gt; C[chat&lt;br/&gt;模型推理]&#10;    C --&gt; D{要调用工具?}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[execute_tool&lt;br/&gt;工具执行]&#10;    E --&gt; B&#10;    D --&gt;|委派| F[invoke_agent&lt;br/&gt;子智能体]&#10;    F --&gt; C&#10;    B --&gt; G[汇总结果]&#10;    B -.-&gt; H[(trace 后端&lt;br/&gt;Langfuse / Jaeger)]&#10;    C -.-&gt; H&#10;    E -.-&gt; H\">flowchart TD\n    A[一次用户任务&lt;br/&gt;root span] --&gt; B[invoke_agent&lt;br/&gt;主智能体]\n    B --&gt; C[chat&lt;br/&gt;模型推理]\n    C --&gt; D{要调用工具?}\n    D --&gt;|是| E[execute_tool&lt;br/&gt;工具执行]\n    E --&gt; B\n    D --&gt;|委派| F[invoke_agent&lt;br/&gt;子智能体]\n    F --&gt; C\n    B --&gt; G[汇总结果]\n    B -.-&gt; H[(trace 后端&lt;br/&gt;Langfuse / Jaeger)]\n    C -.-&gt; H\n    E -.-&gt; H</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>观测信号</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>关键载体</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Trace（span 树）</td>\n<td>任务在哪一步失败/变慢</td>\n<td><code>invoke_agent</code> / <code>execute_tool</code> / <code>chat</code> span</td>\n<td>根因定位、跨层归因</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Metrics（聚合）</td>\n<td>系统整体是否健康</td>\n<td><code>gen_ai.client.operation.duration</code> 直方图</td>\n<td>告警、容量、SLO</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Token 计量属性</td>\n<td>钱花在哪个模型/子智能体</td>\n<td><code>gen_ai.usage.*_tokens</code></td>\n<td>成本归因、缓存优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Events（内容）</td>\n<td>模型究竟说了什么</td>\n<td>提示与补全事件</td>\n<td>调试、评测（默认关闭）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"追踪的语义约定-opentelemetry-genai\">追踪的语义约定：OpenTelemetry GenAI</h2><p>自建 trace 字段的团队常陷入「后端能看但换一个供应商就断」的困境。OpenTelemetry 的 <strong>GenAI 语义约定（semantic conventions）</strong> 试图统一命名，让追踪数据在 Langfuse、Jaeger、各类云 APM 之间可迁移。其核心是 <code>gen_ai.operation.name</code> 枚举属性，取值包括 <code>chat</code>（模型推理）、<code>invoke_agent</code>（调用智能体）、<code>execute_tool</code>（执行工具）、<code>embeddings</code>、<code>retrieval</code> 等（<a href=\"https://github.com/open-telemetry/semantic-conventions-genai/blob/main/docs/gen-ai/gen-ai-spans.md\">OTel GenAI spans</a>）。</p>\n<p>模型调用 span 上必须能读出 token 用量，属性名为 <code>gen_ai.usage.input_tokens</code> 与 <code>gen_ai.usage.output_tokens</code>；缓存命中与写回单列——<code>cache_read</code> 与 <code>cache_write</code> 输入 token，推理型模型另有 <code>gen_ai.usage.reasoning.output_tokens</code>。规范特别说明：<strong>总量属性「应包含所有类型输入 token，包括缓存 token」</strong>，当供应商同时上报「计费量」和「模型实际消费量」时应上报计费量（<a href=\"https://github.com/open-telemetry/semantic-conventions-genai/blob/main/docs/gen-ai/gen-ai-spans.md\">OTel GenAI spans</a>）。工程含义很直接：把 breakdown 当总量相加会重复计费。</p>\n<p>智能体身份属性把成本落到「人」和「团队」上：<code>gen_ai.agent.name</code>、<code>gen_ai.agent.id</code>（托管智能体的稳定资源 ID，如 Bedrock ARN，而非进程内临时 ID）、<code>gen_ai.agent.description</code>。<code>gen_ai.request.model</code> 是条件必需属性，且<strong>须在 span 创建时写入</strong>，因为它会影响采样决策（<a href=\"https://github.com/open-telemetry/semantic-conventions-genai/blob/main/docs/gen-ai/gen-ai-agent-spans.md\">OTel GenAI agent spans</a>）。</p>\n<p>指标侧对应物是直方图而非计数器：<code>gen_ai.client.operation.duration</code>（秒）、<code>gen_ai.invoke_agent.duration</code>、<code>gen_ai.invoke_agent.inference_calls</code>、<code>gen_ai.invoke_agent.tool_calls</code>（<a href=\"https://github.com/open-telemetry/semantic-conventions-genai/blob/main/docs/gen-ai/gen-ai-metrics.md\">OTel GenAI metrics</a>）。用直方图记录工具调用次数看似浪费，但只有分布才能回答「P99 的智能体是否陷入循环」——平均值会把卡死的尾部完全抹平。</p>\n<p>需要清醒的一点：截至 2026 年，多数 <code>gen_ai.*</code> 属性仍标记为 <strong>Development（开发中）</strong> 稳定级别，只有 <code>error.type</code>、<code>server.address</code> 等通用属性是 Stable。落地时应在自建规范层做一次字段映射，避免上游改名时全链路重写。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成本归因与-token-计量\">成本归因与 token 计量</h2><p>成本治理的第一步是能在一个数字上对账。单轮任务的花费是各次模型调用之和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>turn</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>in</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>O</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>out</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mi>k</mi><mtext>cw</mtext></msubsup><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>cw</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mi>k</mi><mtext>cr</mtext></msubsup><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>cr</mtext></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{turn}} = \\sum_{k=1}^{N}\\left(I_k p_{\\text{in}} + O_k p_{\\text{out}} + I_k^{\\text{cw}} p_{\\text{cw}} + I_k^{\\text{cr}} p_{\\text{cr}}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">turn</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1304em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">out</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cw</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cw</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cr</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cr</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 次调用的输入 token，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>O</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为输出 token，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mi>k</mi><mtext>cw</mtext></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_k^{\\text{cw}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9664em;vertical-align:-0.2831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4169em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cw</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mi>k</mi><mtext>cr</mtext></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_k^{\\text{cr}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9664em;vertical-align:-0.2831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4169em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cr</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 分别为缓存<strong>写入</strong>与<strong>读取</strong>的 token，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 为各自单价。以 2026 年 Claude 定价为例（美元/百万 token）：Sonnet 5.5 输入 $2、输出 $10、缓存读取 $0.20、缓存写入 $2.50；Haiku 4.5 输入 $1、输出 $5（<a href=\"https://claude.com/pricing\">claude.com/pricing</a>）。缓存读取约为输入价的 <strong>0.1 倍</strong>，缓存写入约为 <strong>1.25 倍</strong>——缓存只在「同一段前缀被反复读取」时才划算。Agent 场景天然适合缓存：系统提示、工具定义、检索文档在整轮任务里被反复拼进上下文；但多轮工具调用会把前缀一次次写回（写回比裸输入更贵），所以缓存比例必须在 trace 里逐 span 观察。</p>\n<p>归因的粒度决定治理的上限。至少要能按三个维度切分：<strong>模型维度</strong>（贵模型是否用在不需要推理的子任务上）、<strong>子智能体维度</strong>（<code>gen_ai.agent.name</code> 谁的消耗最大）、<strong>工具维度</strong>（<code>execute_tool</code> 返回的大段文档是否被原样塞回上下文）。Anthropic 的实测给出优化优先级：在 BrowseComp 上，<strong>把模型从 Sonnet 3.7 升级到 Sonnet 4 的收益，大于把 3.7 的 token 预算翻倍</strong>（<a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/engineering/multi-agent-research-system\">Anthropic</a>）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优化杠杆</th>\n<th>作用点</th>\n<th>观测依据</th>\n<th>代价/风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>升级模型</td>\n<td>单次推理质量</td>\n<td>token 用量 vs 通过率曲线</td>\n<td>单价上升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工具描述重写</td>\n<td>减少无效工具调用</td>\n<td><code>invoke_agent.tool_calls</code> 直方图</td>\n<td>需回归测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前缀缓存</td>\n<td>重复上下文的输入费</td>\n<td><code>cache_read</code> / <code>cache_write</code> 比</td>\n<td>前缀不稳定时负收益</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>子智能体降级到小模型</td>\n<td>委派型子任务</td>\n<td>按 <code>agent.name</code> 切分的成本</td>\n<td>任务成功率下降</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个经验锚点：修复一个描述有缺陷的 MCP 工具后，Anthropic 观测到后续智能体的任务完成时间<strong>下降 40%</strong>——工具契约质量会直接体现在延迟与消耗指标上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延迟剖析与关键路径\">延迟剖析与关键路径</h2><p>延迟和成本不同，它不能简单相加。一轮任务的墙钟时间由串行段与并行段混合构成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>turn</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>serial</mtext></mrow></munder><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>parallel</mtext></mrow></munder><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>queue</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{turn}} = \\sum_{s \\in \\text{serial}} L_s + \\sum_{p \\in \\text{parallel}} \\max_{j \\in p} \\ell_j + L_{\\text{queue}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">turn</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3795em;vertical-align:-1.3295em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">serial</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3295em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4882em;vertical-align:-1.4382em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">parallel</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4382em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8638em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">queue</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>queue</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{queue}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">queue</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是排队与限流等待时间——多子智能体并发时它常是最大的隐藏项，因为并发配额打满后请求会阻塞而非失败。这个式子说明：<strong>并行化把「和」变成「最大值」</strong>，所以优化要先找最宽的那条串行链，而不是均匀地给每一步加速。Anthropic 的实测印证了这一点：把子智能体并行到 <strong>3–5 个</strong>、每个内部并行 <strong>3 个以上</strong>工具调用，复杂查询的研究时间<strong>最多缩短 90%</strong>（<a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/engineering/multi-agent-research-system\">Anthropic</a>）。</p>\n<p>延迟 trace 的读法是「自顶向下摊开」：根 span 时长若远大于其子 span 之和，差额就是排队、序列化或框架开销；若某个 <code>execute_tool</code> span 独占大头，去查那个外部依赖；若 <code>chat</code> span 数量异常多，往往意味着工具返回值不完整，模型在反复试探。Anthropic 的实验提到，超过 <strong>200,000 token</strong> 的上下文会被截断，主智能体因此需要把计划写入外部记忆——这类额外轮次在 trace 里表现为长尾 <code>chat</code> 序列，是延迟治理的重点。</p>\n<p>采样策略必须与延迟目标联动。把 <code>gen_ai.request.model</code> 写进 span 创建阶段，就能对高价值模型调用做<strong>全量采样</strong>、对廉价子任务做<strong>低比例采样</strong>，兼顾排障精度与存储成本。这与 <a href=\"agent-sandbox-execution-safety\">智能体沙箱与代码执行安全</a> 的资源限额同属「给自主行为设上界」的思路。</p>\n<h2 id=\"治理闭环-预算-告警与内容捕获\">治理闭环：预算、告警与内容捕获</h2><p>观测数据只有接回控制回路才有价值。一个可落地的闭环分四层，从软到硬依次收紧：<strong>观测</strong>（常态记录 span、token、时长）→ <strong>告警</strong>（单轮成本超阈值或 P99 延迟越界时通知值班）→ <strong>限流</strong>（单会话 token 累计超预算时拒绝新调用或降级模型）→ <strong>熔断</strong>（检测到同工具重复调用 N 次即强制终止并回滚）。阈值应从历史 trace 的分位数反推，而非拍一个整数。Langfuse 这类后端提供开箱能力：Hobby 免费层含 <strong>50k units/月、30 天数据</strong>；Core $29/月含 <strong>100k units</strong>，单位定义为「任何送入平台的追踪数据点」，trace、span、generation、score 均计入，超额按 $8/100k 起阶梯计费（<a href=\"https://langfuse.com/pricing\">Langfuse Pricing</a>）。</p>\n<p><strong>内容捕获必须默认关闭</strong>，这是隐私与成本的共同要求。OpenTelemetry 的内容采集走环境变量 <code>OTEL_INSTRUMENTATION_GENAI_CAPTURE_MESSAGE_CONTENT</code> 显式开启；关闭时 span 只保留操作元数据（模型、token、时长、错误类型），不落提示与补全原文（<a href=\"https://opentelemetry.io/blog/2024/otel-generative-ai/\">OTel blog</a>）。开启后模型消息可能含系统提示、用户输入、工具参数与返回——最敏感、也最容易原样写进外部后端的字节。工程默认应遵循「私有路径零配置」：不开启就只上报计数与类别，调试时才按会话临时开启并设短保留期。</p>\n<p>最后是版本漂移风险。GenAI 约定多数仍处 Development 阶段；把观测层做成一层薄适配（应用侧只发自有事件，出口处映射到 OTel 命名），可把改动限制在一个模块内。这与 <a href=\"agent-state-persistence-recovery\">智能体状态持久化与恢复</a> 的稳定性问题同源：运行时基础设施的价值恰恰在于把上游变化挡在边界之外。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Agent 的可观测性是<strong>树形 trace</strong>，根 span 挂 <code>invoke_agent</code> / <code>execute_tool</code> / <code>chat</code> 三类子 span，而非接口级日志。</li>\n<li>成本量级：单 Agent 约为聊天的 <strong>4 倍</strong> token，多智能体约 <strong>15 倍</strong>；token 用量可解释 BrowseComp <strong>80%</strong> 的性能方差。</li>\n<li>用 OpenTelemetry GenAI 约定统一命名：<code>gen_ai.usage.input_tokens/output_tokens</code>、<code>cache_read/write</code>、<code>gen_ai.operation.name</code>、<code>gen_ai.agent.name</code>；多数属性仍是 Development 稳定级，需一层适配隔离漂移。</li>\n<li>成本公式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>turn</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>in</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>O</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>out</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mi>k</mi><mtext>cw</mtext></msubsup><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>cw</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mi>k</mi><mtext>cr</mtext></msubsup><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>cr</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{turn}} = \\sum_k (I_k p_{\\text{in}} + O_k p_{\\text{out}} + I_k^{\\text{cw}} p_{\\text{cw}} + I_k^{\\text{cr}} p_{\\text{cr}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">turn</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">out</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9664em;vertical-align:-0.2831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4169em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cw</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cw</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0331em;vertical-align:-0.2831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4169em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cr</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cr</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>；缓存读取约 0.1 倍输入价、写入约 1.25 倍，只在重复前缀下划算。</li>\n<li>延迟公式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>turn</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{turn}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">turn</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的并行段取最大值；3–5 个子智能体并行在复杂查询上最多缩短 90%。治理闭环四层：观测 → 告警 → 限流 → 熔断，内容捕获默认关闭。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"可观测性、追踪与成本/延迟治理","id":"可观测性-追踪与成本-延迟治理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"追踪的语义约定：OpenTelemetry GenAI","id":"追踪的语义约定-opentelemetry-genai"},{"level":2,"text":"成本归因与 token 计量","id":"成本归因与-token-计量"},{"level":2,"text":"延迟剖析与关键路径","id":"延迟剖析与关键路径"},{"level":2,"text":"治理闭环：预算、告警与内容捕获","id":"治理闭环-预算-告警与内容捕获"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"运行时状态持久化与故障恢复","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/agentic-ai-engineering-systems/agent-runtime-systems/agent-state-persistence-recovery"},"next":{"title":"智能体评测脚手架与基准设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/agentic-ai-engineering-systems/agent-eval-safety-governance/agent-evaluation-harness-benchmarks"}}